+ alpha
  $ {CLAUDE} mcp add --scope user alpha -- /opt/alpha/bin/alpha
~ bravo
  $ {CLAUDE} mcp remove --scope user bravo
  $ {CLAUDE} mcp add --scope user bravo -- /opt/bravo/v2/bin/bravo
~ charlie
  $ {CLAUDE} mcp remove --scope user charlie
  $ {CLAUDE} mcp add --scope user charlie -- /opt/charlie/v2/bin/charlie
- zulu
  $ {CLAUDE} mcp remove --scope user zulu
(dry-run — no changes applied)
